5%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교육공무원 임용에 결격사유가 없는 자.</font></span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 초빙분야의 박사학위 소지자(Postdoc. 우대).<br><br><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008080\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"5\">3. 임용예정일</font></font> <strong><font size=\"4\">▶ </font></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"4\"><strong>2010. 2. 1.</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong> </strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></font></span> </p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br><br><font face=\"Times New Roman\" color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\">&nbsp;4. 제출서류</font>&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">가.&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">계약교원신규채용 지원서(본교 소정양식) 1부.<br></font></span><br>&nbsp; 나. 이력서(본교 소정양식) 1부.&nbsp; </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학력 및 성적증명서(학사, 석사, 박사) 원본 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">(외국대학에서 학위를 취득한 경우는 학위증 사본과 본인이 날인한 국문 번역본 제출)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 50.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 경력증명서(이력서에 기재된 모든 경력) 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 외국어로 된 증명서는 본인이 날인한 번역문을 첨부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 국외경력은 주한 해당국 공관이나 주재국 한국공관에서 공증을 받은 것에 한함.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 37.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">부득이 사본을 제출한 경우에는 원본과 대조할 수 있도록 원본을 지참하여 확인을 받고, </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">본인이 서명한 후 제출.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">. 재직증명서(해당자에 한하며, 재직기간이 명시된 것) 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 석사 및 박사학위논문(기간 제한 없음) 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;사. 연구실적물[최근 4년이내(’</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">06.1.6 ~ ’10.1.7</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">) 실적물에 한하여 원본 또는 별쇄본] 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 40.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">아. 자기소개서(A4용지 2장 이내, 서식 제한 없음) 1부.<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br><!--StartFragment-->\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"2\">《소정양식은 첨부 화일을 다운받아 한글로 작성하시어 제출하시기 바람≫</font></span></font></p><font face=\"굴림\">\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br><br><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\">&nbsp;5. 지원서 접수</font>&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">가. 접수기간 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">2010. 1. 12.(화) ~ 1. 14.(목) 09:00 ~ 18:00</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수방법 및 접수처</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 방문접수 : 본교 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터(공동실험실습관 4층 401호)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 우편접수 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;그린에너지시스템인재양성센터(기한 내 도착분에 한함)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;※ </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">본인 외 대리접수 가능, 우편접수 시 반드시 전화로 접수상태 확인할 것.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\">&nbsp;6. 기타</font>&nbsp;<br><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본 공고에 명시되지 않은 사항은 교육공무원법 등 관계 법령 및 본교 인사관련 규정에 의함.</font></span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 시 구비서류가 미비 또는 기한 내 도착하지 않을 경우 접수하지 않음.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 심사 후&nbsp;면접대상자는 개별 통지함.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 계약 기간은 1년이며, 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 사업기간(~2014.5.31.) 동안 재임용 가능.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 적격자가 없을 경우 초빙하지 않을 수 있음.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 기타 상세한 사항은 본교 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 행정지원팀으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.<br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 전화 : (054)478-7947 / 팩스 : (054)478-7934</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">▶ 홈페이지 : </span></font><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">http://www.kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></a><strong><font face=\"굴림\"> , </font></strong><a href=\"http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
